---
import "../../viewport-scale.css";
const title = "猪猪小记编辑室 | Cochonnet Villa";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hans">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class="notes-studio">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="stale-banner" id="stale-banner" role="status" hidden>
        <p class="stale-banner-text" id="stale-banner-text"></p>
        <button class="button button-primary" id="stale-sync-button" type="button">同步最新内容</button>
      </div>

      <section class="masthead">
        <p class="eyebrow">猪猪小记 · 编辑室</p>
        <h1>写一篇随笔，保存后直接发布到网站。</h1>
        <p>
          发布会把 <code>content/notes.json</code> 提交到 GitHub，网站在 1–2 分钟后自动更新。
          正文使用标准 Markdown：空行分段、<code>## 小标题</code>、<code>- 列表</code>、<code>1. 有序列表</code>、
          <code>&gt; 引用</code>、<code>[链接](网址)</code>、<code>**加粗**</code>、<code>*斜体*</code> 和代码块。
          标记符号后要留一个空格；旧式 <code>##小标题</code> 会在保存时自动规范。原始 HTML 不会执行。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/notes/">打开小记页面</a>
          <a class="button button-muted" href="/admin/">返回内容工作室</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="layout">
        <div class="stack">
          <section class="card">
            <h2>登录（GitHub token）</h2>
            <p class="helper">
              和 <code>/admin/</code> 共用同一个 fine-grained token（需要
              <code>Contents: Read and write</code> 权限）。保存一次，两个编辑器都算登录。
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <label for="token-input">GitHub token</label>
              <input id="token-input" type="password" placeholder="粘贴 token 后点保存" autocomplete="off" />
            </div>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="save-token-button" type="button">保存 token</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="clear-token-button" type="button">清除 token</button>
            </div>
            <div class="status" id="auth-status">正在检查……</div>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <h2>小记列表</h2>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="new-note-button" type="button">写新的一篇</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="reload-button" type="button">重新读取</button>
              <button
                class="button button-muted"
                id="toggle-list-button"
                type="button"
                aria-controls="notes-list"
                aria-expanded="false"
                hidden
              >展开全部</button>
            </div>
            <div class="note-list" id="notes-list"></div>
            <div class="status" id="list-status">正在读取……</div>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <h2>发布</h2>
            <div>
              <label for="commit-message-input">提交说明</label>
              <input id="commit-message-input" type="text" value="更新猪猪小记" />
            </div>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="publish-button" type="button">发布到 GitHub</button>
            </div>
            <div class="status" id="publish-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
              列表和网站保持一致。
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="stack">
          <section class="card editor-card" id="editor-card">
            <div class="editor-topbar">
              <div class="editor-topbar-row">
                <h2>编辑器</h2>
                <div class="editor-topbar-buttons">
                  <button class="button button-muted" id="editor-float-button" type="button">弹出窗口</button>
                  <button class="button button-primary" id="publish-button-top" type="button">发布到 GitHub</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="status" id="publish-status-top" aria-hidden="true">列表和网站保持一致。</div>
            </div>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <div>
                <label for="title-input">标题</label>
                <input id="title-input" type="text" placeholder="今天想记点什么？" />
              </div>
              <div class="field-row">
                <div>
                  <label for="date-input">日期</label>
                  <input id="date-input" type="date" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="mood-input">心情（可选）</label>
                  <input id="mood-input" type="text" placeholder="🐷" maxlength="8" />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="field-body">
                <label for="body-input">正文</label>
                <textarea id="body-input" spellcheck="false" placeholder="## 小标题\n\n正文使用标准 Markdown……"></textarea>
                <p class="helper">
                  需要让配图认出固定角色时，请在正文第一次出现处写隐藏标记，例如
                  <code>[[小猪]]</code>。预览和正式页面只会显示“小猪”；裸写“小猪”会被当作普通描述，不会套用刘海小猪的角色档案。
                </p>
                <div class="status" id="markdown-status" aria-live="polite">
                  Markdown 格式正常；预览与正式页面使用同一套规则。
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="studio-actions" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="save-note-button" type="button">收进列表</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="delete-note-button" type="button">清空重写</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="backup-draft-button" type="button">备份草稿</button>
            </div>
            <div class="status" id="editor-status">每次输入都会自动存进本浏览器，不怕误关页面。</div>
            <div class="status" id="draft-status">
              停笔 5 分钟自动把草稿（含未发布的列表修改）备份到仓库的 notes-drafts 分支，也可点「备份草稿」。换浏览器打开会自动恢复；发布成功后自动清空。
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="card editor-placeholder" id="editor-placeholder" hidden>
            <h2>编辑器</h2>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.6rem;">
              编辑器已经弹出为浮动窗口：拖标题栏移动，拉边缘和四角改大小，双击标题栏最大化。
            </p>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-muted" id="editor-dock-button" type="button">收回到页面</button>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <h2>预览</h2>
            <div class="preview">
              <p class="preview-meta" id="preview-meta"></p>
              <h3 class="preview-title" id="preview-title">（还没有标题）</h3>
              <div class="preview-body note-body" id="preview-body"></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editor-window" id="editor-window" aria-label="浮动编辑器窗口" hidden>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="n"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="s"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="e"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="w"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="ne"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="nw"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="se"></div>
      <div class="editor-window-handle" data-edge="sw"></div>
    </div>

    <dialog
      class="publish-success-dialog"
      id="publish-success-dialog"
      aria-labelledby="publish-success-title"
      aria-describedby="publish-success-description"
    >
      <div class="publish-success-card">
        <div class="publish-success-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
        <p class="eyebrow">已经交给 GitHub</p>
        <h2 id="publish-success-title">发布成功</h2>
        <p id="publish-success-description">
          小记已经成功提交。网站正在重新部署，通常会在 1–2 分钟后更新。
        </p>
        <form class="publish-success-actions" method="dialog">
          <button class="button button-primary" type="submit" autofocus>继续编辑</button>
          <a class="button button-muted" href="/notes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开小记页面</a>
        </form>
      </div>
    </dialog>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --paper: #fff8ef;
    --shell: rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.86);
    /* 浮动窗口用的实色版本：窗口浮在页面上，透明会把背后的卡片透出来 */
    --shell-solid: #fffcf6;
    --ink: #4e2f33;
    --ink-soft: #71535d;
    --rose: #f8a6ba;
    --rose-deep: #d86b8d;
    --peach: #f5b57e;
    --line: rgba(120, 76, 78, 0.14);
    --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(104, 63, 45, 0.14);
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body.notes-studio {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 320px;
    font-family: "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(248, 166, 186, 0.42), transparent 26%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 12%, rgba(245, 181, 126, 0.3), transparent 22%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fffaf3 0%, #fff0dc 55%, #fffaf2 100%);
  }

  .notes-studio a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .shell {
    width: min(var(--shell-max, 73.75rem), calc(100% - var(--shell-gutter-tight, 1.25rem)));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .masthead,
  .notes-studio .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--shell);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .notes-studio .masthead {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Shown only when a background tab comes back holding an outdated sha. */
  .notes-studio .stale-banner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 181, 126, 0.55);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(245, 181, 126, 0.22);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .notes-studio .stale-banner[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .stale-banner-text {
    flex: 1 1 18rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: #6f4a20;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .notes-studio .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  .notes-studio h1,
  .notes-studio h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .notes-studio h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .notes-studio h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .notes-studio p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .notes-studio .hero-links,
  .notes-studio .studio-actions,
  .notes-studio .token-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .notes-studio .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 2.7rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: white;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .notes-studio .button-primary {
    color: #fff9f6;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose-deep), #dd8b56);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.28);
  }

  .notes-studio .button-muted {
    border-color: var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
  }

  .notes-studio .button[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .button:disabled {
    cursor: wait;
    opacity: 0.58;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .publish-success-dialog {
    width: min(31rem, calc(100% - 2rem));
    max-height: calc(100dvh - 2rem);
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow: auto;
  }

  .notes-studio .publish-success-dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgba(78, 47, 51, 0.38);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .notes-studio .publish-success-card {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: #fffaf3;
    box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(78, 47, 51, 0.28);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .notes-studio .publish-success-mark {
    display: grid;
    width: 3.6rem;
    height: 3.6rem;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(173, 199, 138, 0.28);
    color: #36512f;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .notes-studio .publish-success-actions {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .publish-success-actions .button {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .notes-studio .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .notes-studio .stack {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .card {
    padding: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-topbar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0.6rem;
    z-index: 5;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 250, 243, 0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(104, 63, 45, 0.1);
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-topbar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-topbar .status {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-topbar-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ---- 浮动编辑器窗口 ---- */

  .notes-studio .editor-window {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 40;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window .editor-card {
    height: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: auto;
    border-color: rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.4);
    background: var(--shell-solid);
    box-shadow: 0 42px 120px rgba(78, 47, 51, 0.34);
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-card.is-floating .editor-topbar {
    position: static;
    /* 吸顶条在窗口里不需要毛玻璃：实色才不会透出下面的页面 */
    background: var(--shell-solid);
    backdrop-filter: none;
    cursor: grab;
    user-select: none;
    touch-action: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-card.is-floating .editor-topbar.is-dragging {
    cursor: grabbing;
  }

  /* 浮动时正文框高度由 JS 按窗口剩余空间分配（fitEditorHeight）；
     手动拖拽高度的需求交给窗口边缘手柄，避免两套调节互相打架 */
  .notes-studio .editor-card.is-floating textarea {
    min-height: 8rem;
    resize: none;
  }

  /* 浮动模式压缩表头：标题和日期/心情并排一行，把高度让给正文 */
  .notes-studio .editor-card.is-floating .field-grid {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-card.is-floating .field-body {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  /* 静态说明文字在浮动窗里省下来给正文；收回页面后仍然可见 */
  .notes-studio .editor-card.is-floating #draft-status {
    display: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    touch-action: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="n"],
  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="s"] {
    left: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    height: 12px;
    cursor: ns-resize;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="n"] {
    top: -6px;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="s"] {
    bottom: -6px;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="e"],
  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="w"] {
    top: 14px;
    bottom: 14px;
    width: 12px;
    cursor: ew-resize;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="e"] {
    right: -6px;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="w"] {
    left: -6px;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="ne"],
  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="nw"],
  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="se"],
  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="sw"] {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="ne"] {
    top: -7px;
    right: -7px;
    cursor: nesw-resize;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="nw"] {
    top: -7px;
    left: -7px;
    cursor: nwse-resize;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="se"] {
    bottom: -7px;
    right: -7px;
    cursor: nwse-resize;
  }

  .notes-studio .editor-window-handle[data-edge="sw"] {
    bottom: -7px;
    left: -7px;
    cursor: nesw-resize;
  }

  .notes-studio label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .notes-studio input,
  .notes-studio textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
  }

  .notes-studio input {
    min-height: 2.9rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio textarea {
    min-height: clamp(16rem, 42dvh, 34rem);
    padding: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .notes-studio .field-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .field-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .status {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .notes-studio .status[data-tone="success"] {
    background: rgba(173, 199, 138, 0.22);
    color: #36512f;
  }

  .notes-studio .status[data-tone="warning"] {
    background: rgba(245, 181, 126, 0.22);
    color: #6f4a20;
  }

  .notes-studio .status[data-tone="error"] {
    background: rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.18);
    color: #762a44;
  }

  .notes-studio code {
    padding: 0.12rem 0.32rem;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* 展开后仍然给列表封顶：十几篇小记不该把整页撑长，卡片内部自己滚动 */
  .notes-studio .note-list.is-expanded {
    max-height: min(26rem, 46dvh);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem 0.2rem 0.2rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .list-empty {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item.is-editing {
    border-color: var(--rose-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.18);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item-meta {
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item-actions .button {
    min-height: 2.1rem;
